    {
      "text": "With the dual tunnel feature, organizations can capture Per App traffic via a secondary tunnel and send it to the Private Access applications, while all other apps continue tunneling to Internet & SaaS through the primary tunnel."
    },
    {
      "text": "Before using this guide, ensure that Zscaler Client Connector is installed on your device. To learn more, see Deploying Zscaler Client Connector with Microsoft Intune for iOS."
    },
    {
      "text": "With Microsoft Intune, you can configure the dual tunnel feature for iOS devices:"
    },
    {
